Source landscape: The 2023 documentary universe is broad and multi-perspectival, spanning federal oversight and statistical records, UN mechanisms, courts, human-rights organizations, civil-liberties groups, academic work, investigative reporting, and official presidential records. Major source families include policing and protest, immigration detention, Guantánamo and torture accountability, firearm and homicide outcomes, vulnerable-group protection, and federal oversight. Search results were treated as leads only; no evidence claims or scores were extracted.

